    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ND_0006042">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OGMS_0000065"/>
        <metadata:prefixIRI>ND:0006042</metadata:prefixIRI>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A progressive disease course that realizes a neurological disease that involves degeneration of neurons in the brain.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>Alexander P. Cox</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <rdfs:comment>Mark J:
This defintion needs fixing. Makes no sense to say &quot;involves&quot;. What is that? And why the complicated axiom and equivalency here?

Why not simply: &quot;A disease course that realizes a neurodegenerative disease&quot;?</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>neurodegenerative disease course</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


