        <obo:IAO_0000111>Folstein mini mental state examination assay</obo:IAO_0000111>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cognitive functioning assay consisting of a standardized sequence of brief cognitive tasks emphasizing orientation, memory, attention, executive function, and language that generates a scalar score from 0 to 30 that is used as a global measurement of cognitive functioning and to screen for cognitive impairment.

*** REVISE ***</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>Alexander P. Cox</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000118>Folstein MMSE assay</obo:IAO_0000118>
