        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NPT_0011016"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cognitive functioning assay design that attempts to generate a Folstein mini mental examination cognitive functioning numerical measurement datum that can be used in conjunction with other data to classify individuals on the basis of their level of cognitive functioning by means of the results of a cognitive task in which the evaluant&apos;s ability to recall a list of three short words is tested a couple of minutes after they are said out loud by the evaluator during the MMSE immediate recall assay and after the evaluant has completed the MMSE attention and calculation assay.

*** REVIEW ***</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>Alexander P. Cox</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <rdfs:label>MMSE recall assay design</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


