        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cognitive functioning assay design that attempts to generate Folstein mini mental examination cognitive functioning numerical measurement datum that can be used in conjunction with other data to classify individuals on the basis of their level of cognitive functioning by means of the results of a series of questions and cognitive tasks that test the evaluant&apos;s current linguistic abilities.

*** REVIEW ***</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>Alexander P. Cox</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <rdfs:label>MMSE language assay design</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NPT_0011035 -->

