        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cognitive functioning assay design that attempts to generate Folstein mini mental examination cognitive functioning numerical measurement datum that can be used in conjunction with other data to classify individuals on the basis of their level of cognitive functioning by means of the results of a cognitive task in which the evaluant&apos;s current linguistic abilities are tested by being asked to complete three simple tasks in a row after receiving all three commands from the evaluator.

*** REVIEW ***</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>Alexander P. Cox</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <rdfs:label>MMSE three stage command assay design</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


