        <metadata:prefixIRI>NDDO:NDDO_10000756</metadata:prefixIRI>
        <NDDO:NDDO_10000049 xml:lang="en">SMC</NDDO:NDDO_10000049>
        <rdfs:comment>SMC participants score within normal range for cognition (or CDR = 0) but indicate that they have a concern, and exhibit slight forgetfulness. The informant does not equate this as progressive memory impairment nor considers this as consistent forgetfulness.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>Significant Memory Concern</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


