    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NPT_0015004 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NPT_0015004">
        <obo:IAO_0000111>Folstein mini mental examination inventory</obo:IAO_0000111>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The Folstein mini mental examination inventory is a set of questions and tasks used to assess the general level of a person&apos;s cognition.

*** REVIEW ***</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>Alexander P. Cox</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <rdfs:comment>*** QUESTION ***
Is this a questionnaire or is it better classified as something else since it involves both tasks and questions?  What would this something else be?</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>Folstein mini mental examination inventory</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


